{"version":1,"content":"<p>位於佐敦道與渡船街之間的渡船角，由多條「文」字開頭小街所組成，是自成一角的獨特小區，隨着近年變天式發展，吸引不少特色小店進駐，Omakase廚師發辦的高質親民新派日本菜餐廳、泰國過江龍米芝蓮豬腳飯店和創意台式料理居酒屋；</p><p>很多食饕更專程走訪，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:16:58.090038+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T06:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187444+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187444+00:00","content_hash":"d93efa931d5a98521867d65c4396d0258771c2fbeb057d40bb4afecc9795feac","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}